  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Apoyo a los GAD en Vialidad Provincial - PROVIAL</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provincial Road Support Program for GAD: PROVIAL</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This program seeks to support the Decentralized Autonomous Governments (GAD) for increased connectivity between rural roads and the primary road network of Ecuador and improving agricultural productivity at the provincial government level. The program also seeks to reduce logistics costs, improve mobility and access in a sustainable manner with efficiency and safety.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
